title: Bed3B
---
// Talk target of his bed in 3B (Hotspots layer). Going to sleep is the exit of most boxes:
// it ends the box once its steps are done, and says it is too early before that. The
// exit enters the next box (the entry node runs). The breakfast leads to free time, a hub
// without a scene, so its bed starts the next box with a scene itself. So does the way
// out of the knock (door_3b_inside.yarn) and the last bed, which ends the demo.
-> Go to sleep <<if not in_box("R1Viewing")>>
    <<if can("R1MoveIn", "bed")>>
        <<note_done r1_move>>
        <<done R1MoveIn bed>>
    <<elseif in_box("R1MoveIn")>>
        <<if not is_done("R1MoveIn", "carry")>>
            You: My box is still at the bottom of the stairs. Not yet.
        <<elseif $item_blush_socks>>
            You: Not with a pair of pink socks in my hand. They need a place.
        <<else>>
            You: Someone's at my door.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif can("R1Breakfast", "bed")>>
        <<note_done r1_sun>>
        <<done R1Breakfast bed>>
        <<next_scene Route1Thu1Start>>
    <<elseif in_box("R1Breakfast")>>
        <<if not is_done("R1Breakfast", "text")>>
            You: My phone's buzzing. Sleep can wait.
        <<else>>
            You: Her croissant first. It's getting cold.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif can("R1Dinner1", "bed")>>
        <<note_done r1_thu1>>
        <<done R1Dinner1 bed>>
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner1")>>
        You: It's not even eight. Dinner at hers first.
    <<elseif can("R1Dinner2", "knock")>>
        <<note_done thu3>>
        <<done R1Dinner2 knock>>
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner2")>>
        <<if is_done("R1Dinner2", "wait")>>
            You: My phone first. It's been buzzing since I got in.
        <<else>>
            You: Not yet. Tonight's at hers.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif can("R1Dinner2Retry", "knock")>>
        <<note_done r1_retry>>
        <<done R1Dinner2Retry knock>>
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner2Retry")>>
        You: Not yet. Tonight's at hers.
    <<elseif in_box("R1Knock")>>
        <<if not is_done("R1Knock", "open")>>
            You: Not now. She's knocking.
        <<elseif not is_done("R1Knock", "morning")>>
            You: Not now. She's here.
        <<else>>
            You: Work first. It's morning.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif can("R1Notebook", "on")>>
        <<note_done r1_nb>>
        <<done R1Notebook on>>
        <<next_scene Route1NotebookEnd>>
    <<elseif in_box("R1Notebook")>>
        You: Not yet. Her notebook first.
    <<endif>>
-> Put the blush socks on <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and not $r1_thu2_knocked and $item_blush_socks>>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "feet">>
    <<done R1Dinner2 socks>>
    You: Fine. Blush.
-> Look
    <<if in_box("R1Viewing")>>
        {$samantha_name}: This is where the bed goes. There's a mattress, but no frame. The last tenant took it. Sentimental, I suppose.
    <<else>>
        You: My bed. A mattress on the floor, made for once.
    <<endif>>
===
